"""Commercial Operations: the container domain.

Holds the primitives, concepts and classes that two or more of the Commercial Operations domains share, so that
the domains (sales, marketing, legal, customer success, pricing and contracts, partner and channel) never refer to
one another: each refers only to the core and to this container (design decision D2).
"""
from dsl import V, C, K, P, S

